WEBVTT

00:03:07.528 --> 00:03:11.490
The job flyer says they hang out
in that old fortress at the top!

00:03:11.699 --> 00:03:13.450
You're sure excited about this.

00:03:13.659 --> 00:03:15.160
| sure am!

00:03:15.369 --> 00:03:18.664
I'm just brimming with
confidence for some reason lately!

00:03:18.872 --> 00:03:21.667
All right! We got a job to do! Let's go, Happy!

00:03:21.875 --> 00:03:23.502
Aye, Sir!

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:26.797
Just speed it up Don't be afraid

00:03:26.797 --> 00:03:29.633
"Fairy Tail the Movie: Phoenix Priestess"
Just speed it up Don't be afraid

00:03:29.633 --> 00:03:29.842
"Fairy Tail the Movie: Phoenix Priestess"

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:31.969
"Fairy Tail the Movie: Phoenix Priestess"
Run Run Get it start

00:03:31.969 --> 00:03:32.177
"Fairy Tail the Movie: Phoenix Priestess"

00:03:32.177 --> 00:03:32.636
"Fairy Tail the Movie: Phoenix Priestess"
As everything flows away

00:03:32.636 --> 00:03:37.599
As everything flows away

00:03:37.808 --> 00:03:43.522
the clouds ahead are calling

00:03:43.731 --> 00:03:46.191
More more

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:53.282
Speeding Highway

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:56.076
Lined-up Speed gun

00:03:56.285 --> 00:03:58.787
Continuous Crooked street

00:03:58.996 --> 00:04:05.043
Endless Cross road...

00:04:05.252 --> 00:04:10.632
Pierce the wind and dash right up

00:04:10.841 --> 00:04:16.388
to the tops of the clouds

00:04:16.597 --> 00:04:22.227
Freedom is in these hands

00:04:22.436 --> 00:04:27.733
Speed up Speed up Speed up

00:04:27.941 --> 00:04:31.570
Just speed it up Don't be afraid

00:04:31.779 --> 00:04:33.739
Run Run Get it start

00:04:33.947 --> 00:04:39.411
As everything flows away

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:45.375
the clouds ahead are calling

00:04:45.584 --> 00:04:48.086
More more

00:04:48.295 --> 00:04:54.760
Speeding Highway

00:05:02.893 --> 00:05:04.978
And these What's-their-name Bandits...

00:05:05.187 --> 00:05:08.357
The Bacchus Bandits!
We're supposed to catch Geese, their leader!

00:05:08.565 --> 00:05:11.860
The mayor himself posted this job,
so it's gonna be a huge reward!

00:05:12.069 --> 00:05:16.031
Lucy. You got a crazy, greedy
look on your face, you know.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.324
How rude!

00:05:17.533 --> 00:05:19.576
Just stay focused, Happy!

00:05:19.785 --> 00:05:20.619
Ms. Erza!

00:05:20.828 --> 00:05:22.538
Yes, Wendy?

00:05:22.746 --> 00:05:25.916
Is it me, or does the city seem too quiet?

00:05:35.592 --> 00:05:36.718
An ambush, huh?

00:05:36.927 --> 00:05:39.763
You guys ain't gettin' past us!

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:43.267
We're gonna turn ya into fish
food and knock you into the ocean!

00:05:43.475 --> 00:05:45.477
Sounds great! I'm fired up now!

00:05:45.686 --> 00:05:48.564
Our only target is Geese, their leader!

00:05:48.772 --> 00:05:51.567
We won't get our reward
unless we find and capture him!

00:05:51.775 --> 00:05:53.819
| want the reward! Really want it!

00:05:54.027 --> 00:05:56.238
--Reward! Reward!
--Yup, she's turned evil.

00:05:56.446 --> 00:05:58.532
Get 'em!

00:05:58.740 --> 00:05:59.908
Scatter!

00:06:04.955 --> 00:06:08.250
Why are you following us?
Natsu's your partner!

00:06:08.458 --> 00:06:11.587
Because I gotta protect you and all.

00:06:11.795 --> 00:06:13.171
Want a fish?

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:14.673
Mind your own business!

00:06:14.882 --> 00:06:17.217
And this is no time to talk about fish!

00:06:17.426 --> 00:06:19.428
Here goes! Charle! Happy!

00:06:19.636 --> 00:06:23.348
Sky Dragon... Roar!

00:06:28.729 --> 00:06:32.107
That's so mean, Wendy...!

00:06:33.442 --> 00:06:34.443
Sorry...

00:06:34.651 --> 00:06:36.445
Get back here!

00:06:38.780 --> 00:06:40.782
Fish food, huh?

00:06:40.991 --> 00:06:43.493
Well, I'm gonna grill you like fish!

00:06:43.702 --> 00:06:45.537
Fire Dragon...

00:06:49.541 --> 00:06:52.210
...Roar!

00:06:59.676 --> 00:07:00.886
So mean...

00:07:01.094 --> 00:07:03.138
Sorry, Happy!

00:07:05.515 --> 00:07:08.477
Hand over Geese! I've no business with you!

00:07:08.685 --> 00:07:11.688
You really think we'll give
you our boss just like that?!

00:07:11.897 --> 00:07:15.400
| like you. You're chivalrous.

00:07:15.609 --> 00:07:18.987
In that case... I assume
you've prepared yourselves!

00:07:24.368 --> 00:07:25.661
What the heck?!

00:07:25.869 --> 00:07:27.496
Charge!

00:07:36.964 --> 00:07:40.342
Now, then. Tell me where Geese--

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:43.428
Drat. I guess I overdid things...

00:07:50.477 --> 00:07:52.062
Here we are!

00:07:56.566 --> 00:07:59.987
Fire Dragon Wing Attack!

00:08:04.533 --> 00:08:05.409
So...

00:08:05.617 --> 00:08:07.703
Where's Geese, your boss?

00:08:07.911 --> 00:08:08.954
Don't get naked!

00:08:09.162 --> 00:08:10.497
Lance!

00:08:13.583 --> 00:08:15.502
Man, they just keep comin'!

00:08:15.711 --> 00:08:17.796
Ice Make: Floor!

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:24.720
So, where can I find Geese...?

00:08:24.928 --> 00:08:26.054
Oh!

00:08:29.099 --> 00:08:30.726
Ka-clink!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:33.228
Hey! What's the big idea, Gray?!

00:08:33.437 --> 00:08:34.855
--Hot!
--What are you doing?!

00:08:35.063 --> 00:08:37.274
--Don't send him back here!
--You're bugging me!

00:08:37.482 --> 00:08:40.235
Hot! Cold! Hot! Cold!

00:08:40.944 --> 00:08:41.778
That's enough!

00:08:41.987 --> 00:08:42.863
Y
es, Ma'am!

00:08:43.071 --> 00:08:44.281
Hot!

00:08:46.575 --> 00:08:50.412
Huh?!

00:08:50.620 --> 00:08:53.373
That's his punishment for charring me like that!

00:08:53.582 --> 00:08:55.208
He's such a lost cause.

00:08:55.959 --> 00:08:58.670
Now tell me where Geese is!

00:08:58.879 --> 00:09:00.881
Or else you'll be in for a world of hurt!

00:09:01.089 --> 00:09:02.758
Moo!

00:09:02.966 --> 00:09:06.344
Even though she's in a real pinch,
Ms. Lucy's high-handed nice body...

00:09:06.553 --> 00:09:08.263
...is the greatest!

00:09:08.472 --> 00:09:11.892
Uhh, Taurus. How am I supposed
to question them like that?!

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:15.520
--You can leave now.
--No mooore?!

00:09:15.729 --> 00:09:18.899
Let's try that again! Open, Gate of the Lion!

00:09:19.107 --> 00:09:19.691
Loke!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:22.652
Okay, Lucy. Just leave this to me.

00:09:22.861 --> 00:09:25.280
Regulus Gatling Impact!

00:09:27.157 --> 00:09:28.742
Not you, too...

00:09:30.786 --> 00:09:32.370
Oh, don't be like that, Lucy.

00:09:32.579 --> 00:09:35.999
If you want to beat info out of
someone, one person is all you need.

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.250
You know?

00:09:44.216 --> 00:09:47.469
Happy... Help...

00:09:47.677 --> 00:09:52.808
Can't you do something about that
crazy motion sickness of yours?

00:09:57.813 --> 00:09:58.855
There he is!

00:09:59.648 --> 00:10:01.316
Talk about obvious!

00:10:01.525 --> 00:10:02.442
| got this!

00:10:02.651 --> 00:10:06.113
--Lucy?!
--Man, she's excited, all right!

00:10:13.703 --> 00:10:15.539
Get back here!

00:10:18.875 --> 00:10:21.962
Yes! A dead-end! The reward's as good as ours!

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:23.380
Nope!

00:10:24.881 --> 00:10:26.633
Huh?!

00:10:27.884 --> 00:10:29.719
No way...!

00:10:34.683 --> 00:10:38.895
Wait! Our reward...!

00:10:41.022 --> 00:10:42.607
| can't believe this!

00:10:42.816 --> 00:10:47.028
You not only wrecked the town,
but let Geese get away as well?!

00:10:47.237 --> 00:10:49.698
Yes. It's my fault.

00:10:49.906 --> 00:10:53.118
We're deeply sorry, Mayor.
But the bandits have been routed...

00:10:53.326 --> 00:10:55.036
Don't give me your excuses!

00:10:55.245 --> 00:10:56.997
How can you call yourselves "Fairy Tail"?!

00:10:57.205 --> 00:11:00.667
Do some actual work instead of calling
yourself some self-important name!

00:11:00.876 --> 00:11:02.460
You get no reward!

00:11:04.296 --> 00:11:07.966
I'm sorry, everyone. It's my fault.

00:11:08.175 --> 00:11:09.801
It's okay!

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.678
We're in this together.

00:11:11.887 --> 00:11:14.723
Oh! That's a cool thing to say, Natsu!

00:11:14.931 --> 00:11:18.393
The point is, the master is
going to be mad at all of us.

00:11:18.602 --> 00:11:20.145
Charle...

00:11:21.146 --> 00:11:22.731
Shall we head back?

00:11:48.965 --> 00:11:52.260
| almost didn't think you
were going to come back.

00:11:54.638 --> 00:11:56.389
I'm sorry...

00:11:56.598 --> 00:12:00.143
You promised you would stay
with me forever, didn't you?

00:12:01.561 --> 00:12:04.481
Abnormal magic was detected
in the mountains north of Fiore.

00:12:04.689 --> 00:12:06.608
The cause is under investigation,

00:12:06.816 --> 00:12:12.781
but we've also received reports that
it has obliterated two whole mountains.

00:12:12.989 --> 00:12:17.953
Moreover, we have reason to believe that this
was only a small fraction of its full power.

00:12:18.161 --> 00:12:22.791
In other words, its power
rivals even that of Zeref.

00:12:25.293 --> 00:12:27.671
--We don't know that for sure yet.
--Rivals Zeref...

00:12:27.879 --> 00:12:33.218
But, if this power could result
in the world's destruction...!

00:12:33.426 --> 00:12:36.054
At any rate, we cannot overlook it.

00:12:36.263 --> 00:12:41.893
That is why I've asked you masters here--
to exchange ideas and opinions.

00:12:44.437 --> 00:12:48.650
Those big shots certainly are long-winded...

00:12:48.858 --> 00:12:51.444
| leave it in your hands.

00:13:07.377 --> 00:13:10.297
Buy one and I'll give you another for free!

00:13:11.131 --> 00:13:13.675
All right! We're back!

00:13:13.883 --> 00:13:16.511
It sure is nice to be in Magnolia!

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:17.512
Sorry!

00:13:17.721 --> 00:13:20.765
I'm gonna take a shower at
home before I go to the guild!

00:13:20.974 --> 00:13:23.143
See you in a bit!

00:13:23.351 --> 00:13:25.353
She's clearly feigning her cheerfulness.

00:13:25.562 --> 00:13:27.063
Ms. Lucy...

00:13:27.981 --> 00:13:32.068
Don't worry about it.
She's always been quick to recover.

00:13:37.407 --> 00:13:39.784
We're back!

00:13:42.537 --> 00:13:43.830
Cheers!

00:13:51.254 --> 00:13:52.881
Yo, Natsul!

00:13:53.089 --> 00:13:54.716
How'd it go?

00:13:54.924 --> 00:13:58.219
A total failure! And zero reward at all!

00:13:58.428 --> 00:14:00.472
Welcome back, my dear Gray!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:01.890
Hi, Juvia.

00:14:02.098 --> 00:14:07.145
Oh! This guild without you
was like a sea without water!

00:14:07.354 --> 00:14:09.856
And my romantic rival isn't
anywhere to be seen...

00:14:10.065 --> 00:14:11.941
What are you muttering about?

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:15.904
They say talkin' to yourself's
a sign of old age, you know.

00:14:16.112 --> 00:14:18.323
O-Old age...

00:14:18.531 --> 00:14:20.075
Where's Master?

00:14:20.283 --> 00:14:23.203
The Council called for him.

00:14:23.411 --> 00:14:25.121
He said he's gonna be gone a while.

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.498
| see.

00:14:31.753 --> 00:14:34.130
All right! I'll do better next time!

00:14:40.387 --> 00:14:42.180
Eclair! Eclair!

00:14:42.389 --> 00:14:44.849
Hey! Are you all right?!

00:14:45.058 --> 00:14:48.019
Please! Help Eclair!

00:15:05.912 --> 00:15:08.540
So, you see...

00:15:08.748 --> 00:15:13.670
If I pair the other Phoenix Stone with
the one passed down in my family,

00:15:13.878 --> 00:15:17.632
an extraordinary miracle will occur!

00:15:17.841 --> 00:15:21.970
And I've finally found the girl with the stone.

00:15:22.178 --> 00:15:26.558
The 400th anniversary of the founding of
the Principality of Veronica is coming up.

00:15:26.766 --> 00:15:28.143
As such,

00:15:28.351 --> 00:15:34.107
| wish to put the two stones together at
the celebration, in front of the people!

00:15:34.315 --> 00:15:38.319
So that I'll look absolutely
striking and splendid to all!

00:15:38.528 --> 00:15:42.282
How can we serve you, Duke Cream?

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:48.371
| want you, the Carbuncle guild,
to bring me the other stone.

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.665
You will be handsomely rewarded.

00:15:50.874 --> 00:15:53.209
Adding in your security services
during the anniversary celebration,

00:15:53.418 --> 00:15:56.004
I'll pay you 400 million Jewel.

00:16:01.509 --> 00:16:03.386
400 million...

00:16:03.595 --> 00:16:08.725
So all we basically have to do is catch
the girl with the other stone, right?

00:16:08.933 --> 00:16:11.936
400 million Jewel for such a simple job!

00:16:12.145 --> 00:16:14.772
It's hilarious.

00:16:14.981 --> 00:16:16.191
Chase.

00:16:20.487 --> 00:16:22.489
A Phoenix Stone, huh...

00:16:25.074 --> 00:16:26.868
In the name of Carbuncle,

00:16:27.076 --> 00:16:30.914
the glittering garnet on the forehead of the
beast that lurks in the darkness of night...

00:16:31.122 --> 00:16:33.082
...we shall accomplish this job.

00:17:03.988 --> 00:17:05.073
Here you are.

00:17:05.281 --> 00:17:05.990
Thanks...

00:17:06.199 --> 00:17:08.952
Was she just hungry, maybe?

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:10.078
Who is she?

00:17:10.286 --> 00:17:11.829
| dunno.

00:17:12.038 --> 00:17:13.748
What's that baby bird-looking thing?

00:17:13.957 --> 00:17:16.209
Seems to be her friend...

00:17:16.417 --> 00:17:19.212
--Looks kinda tasty!
--Oh, geez.

00:17:21.297 --> 00:17:22.799
Thank you for the meal.

00:17:23.883 --> 00:17:26.052
You'll be okay now!

00:17:26.261 --> 00:17:29.264
No, I would've been fine
with or without your food.

00:17:29.472 --> 00:17:30.348
Huh?

00:17:30.557 --> 00:17:31.975
Oh, my.

00:17:32.183 --> 00:17:36.062
Eclair! Don't say things like that!

00:17:36.271 --> 00:17:37.355
<i>I'm 3 o reyt</i>

00:17:37.564 --> 00:17:40.191
N-No, it's okay...

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:41.526
I'm Momon.

00:17:41.734 --> 00:17:43.236
She's Eclair.

00:17:43.444 --> 00:17:46.114
| took her in a few years ago!

00:17:46.322 --> 00:17:48.241
Don't you mean the opposite?!

00:17:51.578 --> 00:17:54.622
I'm Lucy! Nice to meet you!

00:18:02.672 --> 00:18:06.175
I'm Natsu! I'm a Dragon Slayer!

00:18:06.384 --> 00:18:07.927
Nice to meetcha, Eclair!

00:18:08.136 --> 00:18:09.220
I'm Happy!

00:18:09.429 --> 00:18:11.973
Want some fish?

00:18:12.181 --> 00:18:13.766
Thanks for your help.

00:18:15.727 --> 00:18:17.437
Let's go, Momon.

00:18:30.533 --> 00:18:32.160
--Wait!
--Charle?

00:18:32.368 --> 00:18:35.747
The forest you're headed for is dangerous!

00:18:35.955 --> 00:18:37.957
Something sad is waiting there...

00:18:38.166 --> 00:18:39.417
Forest?

00:18:40.585 --> 00:18:44.005
The Boundary Forest...

00:18:44.213 --> 00:18:47.759
Yes... Deep inside the Boundary Forest...

00:18:47.967 --> 00:18:48.968
That's where...

00:18:49.177 --> 00:18:51.638
Boundary Forest...

00:18:53.306 --> 00:18:55.099
Let's go, Momon.

00:18:55.308 --> 00:18:56.976
E-Eclair?

00:18:57.185 --> 00:18:58.603
Hey!

00:19:08.071 --> 00:19:10.031
Hold on a minute!

00:19:10.239 --> 00:19:12.075
Where are you going?

00:19:12.283 --> 00:19:13.660
The Boundary Forest.

00:19:13.868 --> 00:19:18.873
| hear that place is filled
with monsters! It's dangerous!

00:19:19.082 --> 00:19:20.375
| have to go there.

00:19:20.583 --> 00:19:22.001
Why?!

00:19:23.252 --> 00:19:24.921
| don't know...

00:19:25.129 --> 00:19:28.591
| don't know why. But I have to go there.

00:19:33.429 --> 00:19:35.973
We'll protect you, then!

00:19:36.182 --> 00:19:37.934
We are wizards and all!

00:19:40.603 --> 00:19:42.522
| don't like magic, actually...

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:45.358
--Huh?
--Eclair!

00:19:45.566 --> 00:19:49.445
Magic sometimes brings sorrow with it.

00:19:49.654 --> 00:19:52.615
Magic... brings sorrow?

00:19:55.451 --> 00:19:57.078
That's not true!

00:19:57.286 --> 00:19:59.080
I'm coming with you!

00:19:59.288 --> 00:20:03.334
Me too! I'm gonna make
you say that you love magic!

00:20:03.543 --> 00:20:04.544
Aye!

00:20:04.752 --> 00:20:06.587
We'll accompany you as well.

00:20:06.796 --> 00:20:09.340
Got nothin' else planned, anyways.

00:20:10.299 --> 00:20:11.759
Guys!

00:20:19.809 --> 00:20:23.020
Hey, let's have them come with us!

00:20:30.486 --> 00:20:32.280
Still as bad as always...!

00:20:32.488 --> 00:20:35.158
Wendy. Your motion sickness spell...

00:20:35.366 --> 00:20:39.287
I'm not supposed to, since using it
all the time will make it stop working.

00:20:39.495 --> 00:20:42.957
Just bear it until we reach
the Rose Garden way station.

00:20:43.166 --> 00:20:46.127
| hate my body...

00:20:49.589 --> 00:20:53.134
Say, where are you from, Eclair?

00:20:53.342 --> 00:20:55.011
| don't remember.

00:20:55.219 --> 00:20:57.221
| seem to be missing part of my memory.

00:20:57.430 --> 00:21:00.183
Huh? You mean like amnesia?!

00:21:00.391 --> 00:21:02.643
Only partially.

00:21:02.852 --> 00:21:04.979
| do remember some things, though.

00:21:05.188 --> 00:21:09.817
Like that I don't like wizards.
Especially nosy ones.

00:21:11.277 --> 00:21:12.653
Don't be like that, Eclair!

00:21:12.862 --> 00:21:17.658
I'm sorry. Eclair's just not very sociable.
She's a good person at heart.

00:21:17.867 --> 00:21:19.327
Pointless chatter.

00:21:19.535 --> 00:21:21.329
If you say so...

00:21:42.975 --> 00:21:44.644
This is awesome!

00:21:44.852 --> 00:21:47.188
The whole town's brimming with magic!

00:21:47.396 --> 00:21:49.023
Wow!

00:21:49.232 --> 00:21:50.274
Happy!

00:21:50.483 --> 00:21:52.443
--Let's eat first!
--Aye, Sir!

00:21:52.652 --> 00:21:54.445
Food! Food!

00:21:54.654 --> 00:21:56.030
That idiot...

00:21:56.239 --> 00:21:57.031
Well, then.

00:21:57.240 --> 00:22:02.495
Let us check in to our hotel and
do as we please until tonight.

00:24:54.875 --> 00:24:57.211
Your room keys, yes? Just a moment, please.

00:24:57.420 --> 00:24:58.212
Certainly.

00:24:58.421 --> 00:25:01.549
What's Erza so happy about?

00:25:01.757 --> 00:25:05.219
Apparently she bought
a wedding dress at a store.

00:25:05.428 --> 00:25:06.554
Huh?!

00:25:06.762 --> 00:25:09.306
--What's wrong?
--Oh, nothing...!

00:25:27.116 --> 00:25:29.535
What's with her, I wonder?

00:25:41.589 --> 00:25:43.507
You're not going to shower?

00:25:46.802 --> 00:25:48.846
Eclair...

00:25:49.055 --> 00:25:50.014
Say...

00:25:50.222 --> 00:25:54.810
| can switch rooms if you don't
want to share one with me...

00:25:55.019 --> 00:25:57.730
-- I don't mind sharing it.
--Huh?

00:25:57.938 --> 00:26:02.443
You have the same look in your eyes as me.

00:26:02.651 --> 00:26:04.195
What are you talking about?

00:26:04.403 --> 00:26:08.866
You have the eyes...
of someone who knows human sorrow.

00:26:09.075 --> 00:26:14.497
| didn't know there were
magic users with those eyes too.

00:26:14.705 --> 00:26:18.125
Human... sorrow...?

00:26:27.093 --> 00:26:28.219
Momon!

00:26:31.847 --> 00:26:36.060
The comfort of being a captive,
or the terror of being fleeing prey...

00:26:36.268 --> 00:26:38.854
--Choose.
--Wh-Who are you?!

00:26:39.063 --> 00:26:40.606
Not you.

00:26:40.815 --> 00:26:41.899
Huh?!

00:26:43.234 --> 00:26:45.277
Run, Eclair!

00:26:48.197 --> 00:26:49.615
Eclair!

00:26:49.824 --> 00:26:51.700
Natsul!

00:27:01.043 --> 00:27:02.545
Someone's out to get you?!

00:27:02.753 --> 00:27:03.796
Above!

00:27:26.026 --> 00:27:28.821
Eclair! Lucy! Are you okay?!

00:27:35.077 --> 00:27:38.622
Let her blood flow, blade of mine.

00:27:41.500 --> 00:27:42.543
Eclair!

00:27:50.926 --> 00:27:53.846
Natsu! Gray! Happy!

00:27:54.054 --> 00:27:55.806
Who are you?!

00:28:01.103 --> 00:28:03.314
You aren't worthy enough to know my name.

00:28:04.940 --> 00:28:05.733
Wait!

00:28:05.941 --> 00:28:08.485
--Happy! Stay with Lucy!
--Aye, Sir!

00:28:22.041 --> 00:28:23.542
C'mon...!

00:28:34.720 --> 00:28:37.932
Bastard...!

00:28:38.140 --> 00:28:40.517
O starving claws...

00:28:40.726 --> 00:28:41.727
Feed!

00:28:48.817 --> 00:28:50.945
--Damn!
--You're not gettin' away!

00:29:03.123 --> 00:29:05.834
So you waited, huh?

00:29:06.043 --> 00:29:08.587
Fairy... Tail...

00:29:16.095 --> 00:29:17.429
He vanished...

00:29:20.933 --> 00:29:23.519
Huh? So you have no idea what's going on?

00:29:23.727 --> 00:29:25.020
Can you remember anything?

00:29:25.229 --> 00:29:26.689
Hey!

00:29:26.897 --> 00:29:27.815
You okay?!

00:29:28.023 --> 00:29:29.191
What happened?

00:29:29.400 --> 00:29:31.527
Someone's out to get her!

00:29:31.735 --> 00:29:32.778
Oh...

00:29:32.987 --> 00:29:34.238
What?

00:29:34.446 --> 00:29:36.865
Umm, Lucy.

00:29:37.074 --> 00:29:38.701
You're arousing.

00:29:43.414 --> 00:29:46.125
Is your stripping habit contagious or something?

00:29:46.333 --> 00:29:48.544
Th-Thank you, stripping habit of mine.

00:29:48.752 --> 00:29:50.546
Look the other way!

00:29:59.972 --> 00:30:05.811
Visit the wizard Kalard in the Boundary Forest.

00:30:06.020 --> 00:30:11.358
And then deliver this stone to him.

00:30:13.027 --> 00:30:16.655
| think this stone is why I'm being targeted.

00:30:16.864 --> 00:30:18.198
This stone?

00:30:18.407 --> 00:30:21.201
| do sense unusual power from it.

00:30:21.410 --> 00:30:25.080
I've never heard of this wizard named Kalard.

00:30:25.289 --> 00:30:27.958
What is that stone, Eclair?

00:30:28.167 --> 00:30:30.878
Eclair says she doesn't know either.

00:30:31.086 --> 00:30:34.131
But she's had it for as long as she can remember.

00:30:34.340 --> 00:30:37.885
| have no memory of how things started.

00:30:38.093 --> 00:30:42.222
| don't know where I'm from, who I am,

00:30:42.431 --> 00:30:45.809
or what I'm living for...

00:30:46.018 --> 00:30:50.898
But I've started to remember
things little by little recently.

00:30:51.106 --> 00:30:54.777
I'm sure this stone is a clue to it all.

00:30:54.985 --> 00:30:57.905
Won't we find out if we meet this Kalard guy?

00:30:58.113 --> 00:31:01.742
You know where Kalard lives, right?

00:31:01.950 --> 00:31:07.498
| do, although I can't remember who Kalard is.

00:31:07.706 --> 00:31:10.292
Even if it's too late to see him, I have to go there.

00:31:19.301 --> 00:31:20.636
Take this!

00:31:27.267 --> 00:31:28.769
Are you not going to do anything?

00:31:28.977 --> 00:31:30.229
Err, well...

00:31:30.437 --> 00:31:33.232
Let's catch some fish and perk up...

00:31:35.526 --> 00:31:39.321
--Oh, a yummy-looking one!
--Get real!

00:31:39.530 --> 00:31:41.698
Open, Gate of the Water Bearer!

00:31:41.907 --> 00:31:42.866
Aquarius!

00:31:43.075 --> 00:31:45.661
All right, you!

00:31:45.869 --> 00:31:47.538
Chew on this!

00:31:50.958 --> 00:31:53.836
Don't go summonin' me with nasty water!

00:31:54.044 --> 00:31:54.962
You okay, Lucy?

00:31:55.170 --> 00:31:57.089
Not really...

00:32:16.108 --> 00:32:18.068
This is a monster-deterrent barrier.

00:32:18.277 --> 00:32:19.862
It's quite worn-out, though...

00:32:20.070 --> 00:32:21.864
Then we're almost there?

00:32:35.210 --> 00:32:36.712
T-Talk about run-down!

00:32:36.920 --> 00:32:39.173
This is Kalard's house?

00:32:46.555 --> 00:32:49.183
It sure is an old house.

00:32:49.391 --> 00:32:50.350
More like ruins.

00:32:50.559 --> 00:32:51.351
Sheesh...

00:32:51.560 --> 00:32:52.561
Hey.

00:33:17.628 --> 00:33:20.005
This is a remarkable workshop.

00:33:23.467 --> 00:33:24.968
What is it?

00:33:29.264 --> 00:33:30.557
This is...

00:33:33.268 --> 00:33:36.355
...me, as a child.

00:33:36.563 --> 00:33:37.397
Huh?!

00:33:37.606 --> 00:33:39.066
Does that mean...?

00:33:45.197 --> 00:33:46.573
Eclair! Get back!

00:33:47.741 --> 00:33:49.618
Eclair...

00:33:51.370 --> 00:33:52.871
Eclair.

00:33:53.080 --> 00:33:59.002
If you are seeing this, then it means it's true.

00:33:59.211 --> 00:34:02.089
People looking for you came here,

00:34:02.297 --> 00:34:06.051
and survivors of Fire Village
told me what happened as well.

00:34:06.260 --> 00:34:10.722
| am happy that you have survived.

00:34:10.931 --> 00:34:14.601
But, when I think about your fate...

00:34:16.436 --> 00:34:18.814
This is Kalard?

00:34:19.022 --> 00:34:20.274
Eclair...

00:34:20.482 --> 00:34:26.446
My time with you was my greatest joy in life.

00:34:26.655 --> 00:34:31.118
But Fire Village needed you as a priestess,

00:34:31.326 --> 00:34:35.289
and I had the task of
Dispelling the Phoenix Stones...

00:34:35.497 --> 00:34:38.458
Dispel... Nullification magic.

00:34:38.667 --> 00:34:43.422
I'm sure you were a splendid priestess.

00:34:46.466 --> 00:34:49.261
I've completed the Dispel magic.

00:34:49.469 --> 00:34:52.556
But I doubt I'll ever be able to use it...

00:34:54.600 --> 00:34:57.978
I've fallen ill.

00:34:58.186 --> 00:35:03.400
| haven't nearly enough life to hang
on to until you arrive with the stone.

00:35:03.609 --> 00:35:06.028
I'm sorry...

00:35:06.236 --> 00:35:07.029
Eclair...

00:35:07.237 --> 00:35:10.282
You mean he's already...?

00:35:11.283 --> 00:35:13.493
| pray from the bottom of my heart...

00:35:13.702 --> 00:35:18.999
At the very least, I hope you
will find wonderful friends...

00:35:19.207 --> 00:35:21.001
Eclair...

00:35:21.209 --> 00:35:23.712
My beloved daughter...

00:35:24.963 --> 00:35:26.590
Father?

00:35:45.942 --> 00:35:46.860
No luck.

00:35:47.069 --> 00:35:48.195
We searched everywhere,

00:35:48.403 --> 00:35:51.490
but Kalard didn't leave behind
any notes about his Dispel magic.

00:35:51.698 --> 00:35:53.116
| see...

00:35:55.285 --> 00:35:59.581
The real issue is the spell
cast on that Phoenix Stone.

00:36:05.420 --> 00:36:10.884
The wizard Kalard spent his entire
life trying to remove that spell...

00:36:11.093 --> 00:36:15.013
| can only imagine it's something ill-omened.

00:36:41.790 --> 00:36:46.086
| lost my father recently too.

00:36:46.294 --> 00:36:48.797
| wasn't able to be by his side...

00:36:55.387 --> 00:36:57.639
"I hope you will find wonderful friends..."

00:36:57.848 --> 00:37:00.183
Those are lovely final words.

00:37:00.392 --> 00:37:02.352
Wonderful friends...

00:37:04.563 --> 00:37:07.816
| want to be your friend!

00:37:23.415 --> 00:37:27.586
I'd like to make a formal request of Fairy Tail.

00:37:27.794 --> 00:37:31.006
My father spent his entire life
trying to Dispel the Phoenix Stones.

00:37:31.214 --> 00:37:33.049
| want your help to do it.

00:37:33.258 --> 00:37:34.593
We accept.

00:37:34.801 --> 00:37:37.262
--You can count on us!
--Aye!

00:37:38.847 --> 00:37:40.223
Thank you.

00:37:41.725 --> 00:37:47.105
At the loss of many, we have sealed the Phoenix.

00:37:47.314 --> 00:37:51.067
The two Phoenix Stones
are testament to that fact.

00:37:51.276 --> 00:37:53.820
It is because of them we have true peace.

00:37:56.865 --> 00:37:59.159
Doesn't look dangerous to me...

00:37:59.367 --> 00:38:02.204
Why don't we just break it?

00:38:02.412 --> 00:38:04.873
Good thinking, Happy!

00:38:08.210 --> 00:38:12.422
Fire Dragon... Wing Attack!

00:38:14.257 --> 00:38:17.302
Why don't you ever think things through?!

00:38:17.511 --> 00:38:19.304
This is one tough rock...

00:38:19.513 --> 00:38:24.017
If it were easy to break,
Kalard wouldn't have struggled with it!

00:38:24.226 --> 00:38:25.602
Man...

00:38:26.895 --> 00:38:32.526
Incidentally, whatever happened
to the other Phoenix Stone?

00:38:32.734 --> 00:38:36.112
It was stolen... I think.

00:38:36.321 --> 00:38:39.199
The day of the raid...

00:38:39.407 --> 00:38:41.451
Vero... nica...?

00:38:41.660 --> 00:38:43.036
I've heard of that!

00:38:43.245 --> 00:38:46.790
Veronica's a small country to the north of Fiore!

00:39:09.771 --> 00:39:12.315
Who are you guys?!

00:39:12.524 --> 00:39:19.531
We are Carbuncle: the garnet-adorned
beast that lurks in the darkness.

00:39:19.739 --> 00:39:21.783
My name is Dist.

00:39:24.244 --> 00:39:25.287
Natsul!

00:39:28.748 --> 00:39:31.334
--Mr. Natsu!
--Stay down!

00:39:31.543 --> 00:39:33.003
Bastard!

00:39:35.380 --> 00:39:37.424
Hey, pretty boy.

00:39:37.632 --> 00:39:40.176
Looks like you got a date
with me, the great Cannon.

00:39:40.385 --> 00:39:41.761
What?!

00:39:42.220 --> 00:39:42.679
"Pretty boy"

00:39:42.679 --> 00:39:42.929
"Pretty boy" This brute has
professed his love for my dear Gray?!

00:39:42.929 --> 00:39:43.930
“"Pretty boy"™ "Cannon” This brute
has professed his love for my dear Gray?!

00:39:43.930 --> 00:39:45.640
“"Pretty boy"™ "Cannon" "Date™ This brute
has professed his love for my dear Gray?!

00:39:45.640 --> 00:39:46.600
This brute has professed
his love for my dear Gray?!

00:39:46.808 --> 00:39:49.603
Could you please stop batting
your eyelashes at my dear Gray?!

00:39:49.811 --> 00:39:52.898
Huh? I ain't doing that...

00:39:53.899 --> 00:39:55.817
You lie!

00:39:58.820 --> 00:40:02.073
Juvia is water. Those won't work on her.

00:40:06.786 --> 00:40:08.246
Magic bullets?!

00:40:14.669 --> 00:40:16.463
This calls for a real man!

00:40:22.761 --> 00:40:25.180
What shabby Take Overs.

00:40:25.388 --> 00:40:27.557
--Look after Eclair!
--Got it!

00:40:27.766 --> 00:40:28.975
Enough of this!

00:40:34.856 --> 00:40:39.152
The Titania is but an ordinary woman
before me, the great Coordinator.

00:40:39.361 --> 00:40:40.487
--No...
--Requip?!

00:40:40.695 --> 00:40:41.947
You're less than that!

00:40:43.490 --> 00:40:44.282
This is bad...

00:40:44.491 --> 00:40:46.493
Jet! Go get the master!

00:40:46.701 --> 00:40:48.203
Who's gonna protect Levy?!

00:40:48.411 --> 00:40:50.580
| mean after you've gotten her to safety!

00:40:50.789 --> 00:40:53.249
--Oh!
--I'm not the only--

00:40:57.504 --> 00:40:58.964
There.

00:40:59.965 --> 00:41:01.257
Eclair!

00:41:05.762 --> 00:41:07.847
Lucy! Momon!

00:41:11.810 --> 00:41:13.895
Eclair...

00:41:27.534 --> 00:41:30.662
This beauty will soon be eternal.

00:41:32.872 --> 00:41:36.084
Just how are you faring, Dist?

00:41:43.967 --> 00:41:46.219
Eclair's been taken...

00:41:46.428 --> 00:41:49.681
| couldn't do a thing about it!

00:41:49.889 --> 00:41:51.641
I'm gonna go rescue her...

00:41:51.850 --> 00:41:54.477
Momon. You're in no shape for that right now.

00:41:55.520 --> 00:41:58.565
Stealing a client from Fairy Tail...

00:41:58.773 --> 00:42:00.817
You got some guts, all right!

00:42:01.026 --> 00:42:03.153
But now you're gonna pay!

00:42:05.071 --> 00:42:07.032
Oh, my.

00:42:07.240 --> 00:42:10.493
We've been seriously trounced, indeed...

00:42:10.702 --> 00:42:12.537
Gramps! Gajeel!

00:42:12.746 --> 00:42:14.039
Lily!

00:42:15.457 --> 00:42:19.419
Please forgive me. I was unable to
hold down the fort for you, Master.

00:42:19.627 --> 00:42:22.505
Master. Did Jet give you the news?

00:42:22.714 --> 00:42:25.800
Jet? I haven't seen him.

00:42:27.135 --> 00:42:28.678
Master!

00:42:28.887 --> 00:42:30.346
I"'m C o m 1 N 9 I

00:42:31.556 --> 00:42:36.853
We were investigating some unusual
magic power at Master's behest.

00:42:37.062 --> 00:42:40.982
And then we ran smack into
the Principality of Veronica.

00:42:41.191 --> 00:42:43.401
That's what Eclair was talking about...

00:42:43.610 --> 00:42:46.821
The guys who stole the
other Phoenix Stone, huh?

00:42:47.030 --> 00:42:50.283
The ones who attacked the guild, Carbuncle,

00:42:50.492 --> 00:42:54.621
are now the lapdogs of Duke Cream of Veronica.

00:42:54.829 --> 00:42:58.583
They agreed to abduct Eclair
for a large sum of money.

00:42:58.792 --> 00:43:02.754
Veronica celebrates its
400th anniversary tomorrow.

00:43:02.962 --> 00:43:08.343
Duke Cream plans to put the two
Phoenix Stones together at the ceremony.

00:43:08.551 --> 00:43:09.636
Why?

00:43:09.844 --> 00:43:15.433
According to Veronican royal lore,
when the Phoenix Stones become one,

00:43:15.642 --> 00:43:18.645
the sealed Phoenix shall be revived...

00:43:18.853 --> 00:43:23.566
And apparently that'll give you eternal life.

00:43:23.775 --> 00:43:25.735
Eternal life?

00:43:27.654 --> 00:43:32.659
It is said countless people of Fire Village
perished sealing away the Phoenix.

00:43:32.867 --> 00:43:36.496
Its revival would be akin to that of a demon.

00:43:36.704 --> 00:43:38.998
If we can just Dispel one of those stones,

00:43:39.207 --> 00:43:41.793
we can prevent the Phoenix from reviving...

00:43:42.001 --> 00:43:45.672
That's why Kalard was waiting
for her to bring the stone.

00:43:45.880 --> 00:43:49.843
Duke Cream plans to gain the
Phoenix's power and eternal life

00:43:50.051 --> 00:43:51.970
to do whatever he pleases.

00:43:52.178 --> 00:43:54.973
After all, having eternal life means he won't die

00:43:55.181 --> 00:43:58.351
even as the Phoenix goes on a rampage.

00:43:58.560 --> 00:43:59.602
Only he'll survive.

00:43:59.811 --> 00:44:02.272
The hell with that...!

00:44:02.480 --> 00:44:03.523
Master!

00:44:03.731 --> 00:44:06.693
I'm going to rescue Eclair!

00:44:06.901 --> 00:44:09.404
She was crying.

00:44:09.612 --> 00:44:14.701
When I hugged her, she was
trembling so much that I shook too...

00:44:14.909 --> 00:44:19.622
This isn't about having the stone
or the Phoenix or anything else!

00:44:20.915 --> 00:44:23.376
She's a normal girl.

00:44:23.585 --> 00:44:27.755
She cried when she learned her father was dead.

00:44:27.964 --> 00:44:31.092
She's just a normal girl...

00:44:32.802 --> 00:44:35.180
Very well. Go, Lucy.

00:44:35.388 --> 00:44:37.724
Erza. I leave the member selection to you.

00:44:37.932 --> 00:44:40.476
--Right.
--Take a small, elite team.

00:44:40.685 --> 00:44:44.981
Although it's a small country, we can't
afford to go to war with Veronica.

00:44:45.190 --> 00:44:46.232
Understood.

00:44:46.441 --> 00:44:48.776
Wendy. I'll need your anti-motion sickness spell.

00:44:48.985 --> 00:44:50.904
Right! I'll come with you!

00:44:51.112 --> 00:44:52.405
I'm going too.

00:44:52.614 --> 00:44:53.865
Umm, so will Juvia!

00:44:54.073 --> 00:44:55.408
Aye, Sir!

00:44:56.034 --> 00:44:58.995
We must prepare for the worst possible situation.

00:44:59.204 --> 00:45:03.333
| will hurry back to the
Council and give my report.

00:45:19.974 --> 00:45:22.018
Hello, girl.

00:45:22.227 --> 00:45:24.229
Thank you for the Phoenix Stone.

00:45:24.437 --> 00:45:27.273
| really must repay you somehow.

00:45:28.733 --> 00:45:30.693
You mustn't revive the Phoenix!

00:45:30.902 --> 00:45:33.780
Controlling it is beyond our reach!

00:45:33.988 --> 00:45:37.075
It's perfectly within my reach, though.

00:45:46.000 --> 00:45:47.460
That's it, you wench!

00:45:47.669 --> 00:45:50.546
I'm going to execute you tomorrow, as a sacrifice!

00:45:50.755 --> 00:45:52.632
Look forward to it!

00:45:57.887 --> 00:45:59.973
Detestable harlot...

00:46:00.181 --> 00:46:03.643
They may come to retrieve her.

00:46:03.851 --> 00:46:05.561
I'll have my men ready.

00:46:05.770 --> 00:46:07.230
| leave it to you.

00:46:24.539 --> 00:46:26.666
They weren't just a legend?

00:46:26.874 --> 00:46:31.254
Indeed. The Phoenix's revival.
The capture of eternal life.

00:46:31.462 --> 00:46:35.967
The Principality of Veronica will most
likely try to take over all of Fiore.

00:46:36.175 --> 00:46:38.928
Absurd! A small principality wouldn't dare!

00:46:39.137 --> 00:46:42.765
Then how do you explain its connection
with the unusual magic power?

00:46:42.974 --> 00:46:44.851
Listen to what you say, Makarov.

00:46:45.059 --> 00:46:48.855
Are you suggesting we start
a war with a small nation?

00:46:49.063 --> 00:46:50.857
We haven't time to waste.

00:46:51.065 --> 00:46:54.027
As a master, I make a request of the Council!

00:46:54.235 --> 00:46:57.697
In accordance with Article 27 of
the National Security Directive,

00:46:57.905 --> 00:47:00.116
| ask you to issue a threat elimination order

00:47:00.325 --> 00:47:03.244
so as to secure the citizens' lives and property.

00:47:03.453 --> 00:47:06.205
You must vote to prevent the Phoenix's revival.

00:47:06.414 --> 00:47:07.749
You overspeak your bounds!

00:47:07.957 --> 00:47:11.085
W-We need to examine all the information first...

00:47:11.294 --> 00:47:14.088
| told you, there is no time!

00:47:30.855 --> 00:47:35.026
Lousy outsiders, currying favor with His Grace...

00:47:35.234 --> 00:47:38.071
By the blood of antiquity, I order thee.

00:47:38.279 --> 00:47:40.114
Stagger forth.

00:47:40.323 --> 00:47:42.283
Open, sesame.

00:48:00.885 --> 00:48:03.763
We're coming, Eclair.

00:48:28.955 --> 00:48:32.959
Eclair. You are still young.

00:48:33.167 --> 00:48:35.545
You mustn't die...

00:48:53.354 --> 00:48:54.147
So that's it...

00:48:54.355 --> 00:48:55.356
Hey.

00:48:56.524 --> 00:48:58.526
Now I see...

00:49:00.278 --> 00:49:02.196
This is my...

00:49:04.240 --> 00:49:06.617
I've returned...

00:49:08.536 --> 00:49:10.663
It's finally going to happen.

00:49:15.209 --> 00:49:18.004
Who's there?! Gate's closed for today!

00:49:18.212 --> 00:49:20.840
We're Fairy Tail, dammit!

00:49:22.049 --> 00:49:23.926
We don't want any lip from you!

00:49:29.348 --> 00:49:32.351
Once we're inside, focus
entirely on rescuing Eclair!

00:49:32.560 --> 00:49:35.062
All right!

00:49:40.902 --> 00:49:41.736
Your Grace...

00:49:41.944 --> 00:49:43.362
There's nothing to worry about.

00:49:43.571 --> 00:49:47.033
My lovely lapdogs will do all the howling for us.

00:49:58.336 --> 00:50:00.171
You...!

00:50:11.474 --> 00:50:13.351
You, huh?!

00:50:13.559 --> 00:50:16.646
| was meaning to tell you
something if I saw you again.

00:50:16.854 --> 00:50:17.855
What is it?!

00:50:18.064 --> 00:50:20.399
Your taste in clothing is bad.

00:50:20.608 --> 00:50:22.193
Very bad.

00:50:22.401 --> 00:50:23.945
What a coincidence.

00:50:24.153 --> 00:50:26.614
| was going to say the same...

00:50:28.115 --> 00:50:29.575
...to you!

00:50:39.085 --> 00:50:43.047
| thought we could fool the guards into
thinking we're a bunch of girls and cats...

00:50:43.256 --> 00:50:45.800
...but this is a Carbuncle squad.

00:50:47.718 --> 00:50:49.512
--Scared?
--No.

00:50:49.720 --> 00:50:55.768
| just realized that fighting isn't
scary if it's for someone's sake!

00:50:57.270 --> 00:50:59.146
Wendy and I will hold them off.

00:50:59.355 --> 00:51:01.440
You hurry ahead, Lucy.

00:51:01.649 --> 00:51:03.359
Thanks.

00:51:03.568 --> 00:51:04.652
Let's do it!

00:51:22.753 --> 00:51:24.714
The castle is northwest...

00:51:33.764 --> 00:51:36.350
Don't you have anything tastier?

00:51:39.228 --> 00:51:40.146
Hurry, Juvia!

00:51:40.354 --> 00:51:41.480
Right!

00:51:41.689 --> 00:51:47.069
Despite the situation, Juvia is so
happy to be with wonderful Gray!

00:51:47.278 --> 00:51:48.446
--Get down!
--Oh!

00:51:52.241 --> 00:51:53.034
Youl

00:51:53.242 --> 00:51:54.744
You're so bold, my dear Gray!

00:51:54.952 --> 00:51:58.122
Pretty boy! Let's play some more!

00:51:59.457 --> 00:52:03.502
Anyone who messes with Gray--even a meatball
like you--will have to answer to Juvia!

00:52:03.711 --> 00:52:04.962
You romantic rival!

00:52:05.171 --> 00:52:06.047
Calm down!

00:52:06.255 --> 00:52:10.134
Wait! Why are you taking your
clothes off in front of that man?!

00:52:10.343 --> 00:52:11.886
A lover's quarrel?!

00:52:15.222 --> 00:52:16.223
Slicer!

00:52:19.310 --> 00:52:20.853
Shatter to pieces!

00:52:22.647 --> 00:52:24.148
Right in the middle of town!

00:52:27.735 --> 00:52:29.487
Fireworks?

00:52:31.447 --> 00:52:32.448
Eclair...

00:52:32.657 --> 00:52:33.491
Please be okay!

00:52:33.699 --> 00:52:35.326
Halt, you!

00:52:35.534 --> 00:52:37.912
Open, Gate of the Maiden!

00:52:38.120 --> 00:52:39.372
Virgo!

00:52:40.373 --> 00:52:43.959
Do you wish to punish me for
interrupting the celebration, Princess?

00:52:44.168 --> 00:52:45.961
Just take care of them!

00:52:46.170 --> 00:52:47.296
Certainly.

00:52:57.765 --> 00:52:59.183
Got you!

00:53:04.271 --> 00:53:06.065
Princess. Please hurry.

00:53:06.273 --> 00:53:07.483
Thanks!

00:53:09.110 --> 00:53:10.903
Please take care.

00:53:24.208 --> 00:53:29.171
I... had a lot of fun... being with Eclair...

00:53:29.380 --> 00:53:31.173
Momon...

00:53:32.758 --> 00:53:37.263
So I have to pay her back... for all the fun I had...

00:53:37.471 --> 00:53:40.433
| will save Eclair!

00:53:40.641 --> 00:53:42.935
Let me through!

00:53:44.812 --> 00:53:47.273
Wh-Why, you...!

00:53:48.315 --> 00:53:49.775
Momon...

00:53:50.735 --> 00:53:54.697
Just how many weaklings do you have to hurt...

00:53:54.905 --> 00:53:57.116
...until you're satisfied?!

00:53:57.324 --> 00:54:01.287
It's time to grant you death, Salamander.

00:54:04.415 --> 00:54:06.000
Natsu...

00:54:15.342 --> 00:54:19.472
You don't have what it takes
to make this garnet shine.

00:54:25.311 --> 00:54:26.312
Undo!

00:54:32.777 --> 00:54:34.445
Give it up.

00:54:38.657 --> 00:54:42.369
Oh, how cute. Some sort of country girl?

00:54:42.578 --> 00:54:44.997
So this is what you're into?

00:54:45.206 --> 00:54:46.373
Funny!

00:55:01.972 --> 00:55:04.975
Oh, this is the theater.

00:55:07.102 --> 00:55:11.106
She can undo my Requips
because my mind isn't firm enough.

00:55:12.233 --> 00:55:14.652
| must possess unwavering resoluteness!

00:55:16.529 --> 00:55:18.405
You don't have what it takes.

00:55:22.493 --> 00:55:25.496
| think it's time for the finale.

00:55:31.585 --> 00:55:33.879
All right. Come on out.

00:55:40.511 --> 00:55:43.222
Oh? Pretty boy's finished his bath?

00:55:50.354 --> 00:55:53.357
You wrecked our guild...

00:55:54.733 --> 00:55:56.110
Now it's payback time!

00:55:56.318 --> 00:55:57.236
Bring it on!

00:55:57.444 --> 00:55:58.863
Cold...

00:55:59.613 --> 00:56:01.866
...Excalibur!

00:56:07.329 --> 00:56:09.373
Why, you...!

00:56:17.631 --> 00:56:19.466
Let's go, Juvia.

00:56:19.675 --> 00:56:20.926
Yes!

00:56:24.471 --> 00:56:25.764
O bride.

00:56:25.973 --> 00:56:30.227
Henceforth you will belongeth to me, the Phoenix.

00:56:30.436 --> 00:56:33.063
| am undeserving of such honor.

00:56:33.272 --> 00:56:39.194
Why does thou hesitate
to wed thy glorious ruler?

00:56:50.039 --> 00:56:53.000
Oh, what fitting timing.

00:56:57.838 --> 00:57:04.136
"Why does thou hesitate to
wed thy glorious ruler?!" was it?

00:57:04.345 --> 00:57:05.554
| see.

00:57:13.312 --> 00:57:14.730
Have at you!

00:57:14.939 --> 00:57:18.609
| shall slice the wedding cake
that goes by your name!

00:57:18.817 --> 00:57:21.362
What kind of line is that?

00:57:24.114 --> 00:57:26.367
What? I can't undo her Requip?!

00:57:26.575 --> 00:57:27.451
Impossible!

00:57:27.660 --> 00:57:30.079
Don't underestimate a bride!

00:57:40.047 --> 00:57:44.426
Your bride form wouldn't come undone...

00:57:44.635 --> 00:57:49.473
Just how badly do you want to... get married...?

00:57:49.682 --> 00:57:51.850
Wha...?! I-It's not like that!

00:57:55.938 --> 00:58:02.528
| lurk far and wide within
the darkness, just as sins do.

00:58:12.579 --> 00:58:13.747
You...!

00:58:18.585 --> 00:58:20.462
All too easy.

00:58:24.133 --> 00:58:29.763
The great Black Steel Gajeel's
innards are hard too, you know!

00:58:37.104 --> 00:58:39.606
| dunno which shadow's the real deal,

00:58:39.815 --> 00:58:43.610
so I'll just tear 'em all up!

00:59:00.127 --> 00:59:02.588
Happy... Are you up for it?

00:59:02.796 --> 00:59:06.008
I'm okay... I can fly...

00:59:06.216 --> 00:59:07.593
Do it, then...

00:59:07.801 --> 00:59:08.927
Aye...

00:59:12.139 --> 00:59:14.683
Eclair... Lucy!

00:59:15.184 --> 00:59:18.812
Everyone! Let us all celebrate!

00:59:19.021 --> 00:59:23.275
| now possess the two Phoenix Stones!

00:59:23.484 --> 00:59:26.945
Stop! You mustn't put the stones together!

00:59:27.154 --> 00:59:29.531
Annoying girl.

00:59:29.740 --> 00:59:30.532
Your Grace...

00:59:30.741 --> 00:59:33.452
Oh, you're just in time.

00:59:33.660 --> 00:59:35.704
Now then, let's begin

00:59:35.913 --> 00:59:41.877
the Phoenix revival ceremony that will
grant Veronica tremendous power!

00:59:42.086 --> 00:59:44.713
You mustn't revive the Phoenix!

00:59:44.922 --> 00:59:47.007
O fundamental consociate...

00:59:47.216 --> 00:59:49.760
O wandering counterpart...

00:59:50.677 --> 00:59:52.805
Assemble before me!

00:59:53.013 --> 00:59:54.932
| don't care what happens to me!

00:59:55.140 --> 00:59:58.352
Just don't put the Phoenix Stones together!

01:00:05.692 --> 01:00:06.735
No!

01:00:07.569 --> 01:00:10.447
Eclair!

01:00:12.866 --> 01:00:15.035
Eclair!

01:00:27.881 --> 01:00:30.467
No!

01:00:32.052 --> 01:00:35.097
Thank you, Natsu, Happy...

01:00:35.305 --> 01:00:39.810
Like I said, I'm going to save Eclair.

01:00:47.109 --> 01:00:48.944
Momon!

01:00:52.239 --> 01:00:53.657
Eclair!

01:00:53.866 --> 01:00:55.826
| will save you!

01:00:56.034 --> 01:00:57.578
I will!

01:01:00.330 --> 01:01:02.416
Excellent! Come, Phoenix!

01:01:02.624 --> 01:01:04.835
Give me your blood that grants eternal life!

01:01:05.043 --> 01:01:07.045
Give me it!

01:01:07.254 --> 01:01:10.132
| can't stand to see it.

01:01:10.340 --> 01:01:15.429
A depraved man like you, living forever...

01:01:15.637 --> 01:01:16.889
What...?

01:01:17.097 --> 01:01:21.476
If anyone is deserving of eternity... it is me.

01:01:21.685 --> 01:01:23.687
Dist...?

01:01:27.733 --> 01:01:30.027
I will now become ruler!

01:01:30.235 --> 01:01:32.821
An eternal ruler!

01:01:43.665 --> 01:01:44.958
What is that light?

01:01:45.167 --> 01:01:48.587
The light of the Phoenix's revival.

01:01:48.795 --> 01:01:50.339
Master?!

01:01:50.547 --> 01:01:51.757
What's in the box?

01:01:51.965 --> 01:01:53.717
Our trump card.

01:01:53.926 --> 01:01:56.386
Then the Council has given its consent?

01:01:58.972 --> 01:02:00.766
We took it.

01:02:20.994 --> 01:02:22.496
Come forth, Phoenix!

01:02:22.704 --> 01:02:25.624
Grant me eternal life!

01:02:30.963 --> 01:02:34.049
What is that? It's not a bird?!

01:02:44.810 --> 01:02:46.853
But it must have blood!

01:02:48.188 --> 01:02:49.898
The Phoenix's blood!

01:03:02.703 --> 01:03:04.288
Talk about powerful!

01:03:12.421 --> 01:03:13.922
She's alive!

01:03:14.131 --> 01:03:15.465
Eclair!

01:03:17.426 --> 01:03:19.720
Where's Momon...?

01:03:19.928 --> 01:03:23.807
He flew into the fire to save you...

01:03:31.023 --> 01:03:31.815
Natsul!

01:03:32.024 --> 01:03:34.526
Get Eclair somewhere safe!

01:03:34.735 --> 01:03:35.736
Right!

01:03:37.154 --> 01:03:39.448
There is no safe place!

01:03:40.657 --> 01:03:44.745
If we don't stop the Phoenix,
everyone we hold dear will die!

01:03:44.953 --> 01:03:46.121
Natsul!

01:03:47.247 --> 01:03:48.623
Got it!

01:03:48.832 --> 01:03:50.083
Let's do it, Happy!

01:03:50.292 --> 01:03:51.626
Aye, Sir!

01:04:11.229 --> 01:04:12.731
O Phoenix!

01:04:12.939 --> 01:04:14.983
Give me eternal life!

01:04:15.192 --> 01:04:16.860
Give me your blood!

01:04:21.990 --> 01:04:26.745
"The blood of the Phoenix is the
tears it sheds when sealed away."

01:04:26.953 --> 01:04:28.080
It's pointless...

01:04:28.288 --> 01:04:31.083
Dist!

01:04:31.291 --> 01:04:32.918
Don't interfere!

01:04:33.126 --> 01:04:35.879
Is this what you wished for?!

01:05:06.159 --> 01:05:07.202
Hang in there!

01:05:07.411 --> 01:05:09.955
Remain calm and do as instructed!

01:05:10.997 --> 01:05:13.458
Hey! You guys are wizards too!

01:05:13.667 --> 01:05:16.253
The least you can do is help at a time like this!

01:05:16.461 --> 01:05:18.630
We'll stop it.

01:05:18.839 --> 01:05:19.965
Who are you?

01:05:20.173 --> 01:05:22.050
Fairy Tail!

01:05:22.259 --> 01:05:24.845
Hurry! Run! This way!

01:05:25.887 --> 01:05:28.598
We need to get Wendy to heal you!

01:05:28.807 --> 01:05:31.935
--I'm okay...
--No, you're not!

01:05:32.144 --> 01:05:35.897
Lucy. I remember everything now.

01:05:36.106 --> 01:05:37.858
Huh?

01:05:38.066 --> 01:05:42.237
Veronica was built on the ruins of
Fire Village after it was destroyed.

01:05:42.446 --> 01:05:44.573
My village once stood here.

01:05:44.781 --> 01:05:46.825
Huh? But...

01:05:47.033 --> 01:05:50.078
| was already given eternal life.

01:05:50.287 --> 01:05:53.290
On that night, 400 years ago...

01:05:55.500 --> 01:05:58.336
Although it was to save your life,

01:05:58.545 --> 01:06:02.466
| have burdened you with a painful fate.

01:06:02.674 --> 01:06:05.177
| am sorry, Eclair...

01:06:05.385 --> 01:06:10.849
Worshipping the Phoenix Stones was a mistake.

01:06:11.057 --> 01:06:14.186
The Phoenix must not be allowed to revive.

01:06:14.394 --> 01:06:17.439
We must Dispel it...

01:06:19.024 --> 01:06:24.613
Should you be unable to Dispel it,
you must destroy the stone at all costs.

01:06:24.821 --> 01:06:29.701
It is for that purpose that
you will continue to live.

01:06:29.910 --> 01:06:36.041
But, possibly due to the Phoenix's
blood, I'd lost all prior memory.

01:06:36.249 --> 01:06:40.837
| wandered aimlessly, carrying the
stone for no understandable reason.

01:06:42.005 --> 01:06:45.175
For a long, long time.

01:06:45.383 --> 01:06:50.013
Everyone I met and held dear died off before me.

01:06:54.226 --> 01:06:58.939
400 years is an overwhelmingly long time...

01:06:59.147 --> 01:07:02.901
So when you said magic
sometimes brings sorrow...

01:07:03.109 --> 01:07:06.905
If you consider eternal
life the same as magic,

01:07:07.113 --> 01:07:09.991
then it's nothing but pain and suffering...

01:07:19.501 --> 01:07:22.379
Let's go, Eclair! It's dangerous here!

01:07:22.587 --> 01:07:25.924
I'm immortal. I won't mind
if you leave me here.

01:07:26.132 --> 01:07:27.759
No!

01:07:27.968 --> 01:07:32.722
Not a single person in our guild
would run and leave a friend behind!

01:07:37.227 --> 01:07:39.771
It's no good! We'll have to
take it out with direct attacks!

01:07:39.980 --> 01:07:42.065
But if we get close, he'll...!

01:07:42.274 --> 01:07:43.525
Dist, huh?!

01:07:51.032 --> 01:07:54.035
Damn! Where the hell is Erza?!

01:07:56.621 --> 01:07:58.248
Wait for my signal.

01:07:58.456 --> 01:08:00.041
| will search for Eclair.

01:08:00.250 --> 01:08:01.126
Right.

01:08:12.387 --> 01:08:14.264
Why won't you just die?!

01:08:16.266 --> 01:08:17.851
Where is the blood?!

01:08:18.059 --> 01:08:20.770
| will be the eternal ruler!

01:08:25.525 --> 01:08:27.485
Ruler, my butt!

01:08:31.573 --> 01:08:32.866
Pointless!

01:08:36.786 --> 01:08:38.330
Got ya!

01:08:38.538 --> 01:08:40.332
Don't get cocky!

01:08:46.963 --> 01:08:49.507
Can you not see...

01:08:50.717 --> 01:08:53.011
...that everyone is afraid?!

01:09:00.143 --> 01:09:01.394
Eclair!

01:09:09.736 --> 01:09:11.196
We meet again!

01:09:11.404 --> 01:09:13.615
What are you doing here?

01:09:13.823 --> 01:09:16.534
Heard there were some
sorta special stones here.

01:09:16.743 --> 01:09:19.579
Thought they might be worth somethin',

01:09:19.788 --> 01:09:23.500
but it looks like I came at a bad time, y'know?

01:09:23.708 --> 01:09:26.294
Funny how things connect, huh?

01:09:26.503 --> 01:09:29.214
I'm just some lousy sneak-thief,

01:09:29.422 --> 01:09:34.094
but if you'd caught me back then,
you might've gone splat just now.

01:09:37.597 --> 01:09:40.517
Oh, man! I'm outta here!

01:09:40.725 --> 01:09:43.353
<i>Repay me someday! See ya!</i>

01:09:45.313 --> 01:09:49.192
You have the ability to
connect with people, I see.

01:09:49.401 --> 01:09:50.402
Huh?

01:09:50.610 --> 01:09:52.904
Just like you did with me.

01:09:53.655 --> 01:09:56.491
You're not qualified to call yourself a ruler!

01:09:56.700 --> 01:09:58.493
A ruler doesn't need qualifications!

01:09:58.702 --> 01:10:02.622
| only need to live forever with eternal power!

01:10:02.831 --> 01:10:07.252
Eventually I will be worshipped,
deified, and become ruler!

01:10:07.460 --> 01:10:10.422
That ain't what it means to live!

01:10:10.630 --> 01:10:12.090
Enough drivel!

01:10:21.182 --> 01:10:24.102
You hurt Lucy...

01:10:24.310 --> 01:10:26.062
Lowly scum!

01:10:27.313 --> 01:10:29.482
I'm

01:10:29.691 --> 01:10:32.694
...gonna make you pay!

01:10:43.246 --> 01:10:44.372
It's Natsu!

01:10:48.418 --> 01:10:50.837
Do your thing, babies!

01:10:52.589 --> 01:10:55.884
Fairy Machine Gun: Leprechaun!

01:10:59.012 --> 01:11:00.472
Dark Ecriture...

01:11:00.680 --> 01:11:01.848
...Slice!

01:11:08.772 --> 01:11:09.773
Natsul!

01:11:10.690 --> 01:11:12.025
Quit dawdling!

01:11:12.233 --> 01:11:14.819
And you call yourself a Fairy Tail wizard?!

01:11:26.039 --> 01:11:28.208
| don't have the Phoenix's blood yet...!

01:11:28.416 --> 01:11:31.002
If we weren't afraid of dying...

01:11:31.211 --> 01:11:33.671
| will have eternal life!

01:11:33.880 --> 01:11:35.256
Natsu! Now!

01:11:35.465 --> 01:11:40.220
...we wouldn't be able to treat
anyone else with kindness!

01:11:46.017 --> 01:11:47.101
Yes!

01:11:52.565 --> 01:11:55.360
--He did it!
--Yeah, but it ain't over yet.

01:11:55.568 --> 01:11:59.197
Dist may be defeated, but the Phoenix isn't!

01:11:59.405 --> 01:12:01.241
That's true...

01:12:01.449 --> 01:12:04.202
--"A small, elite team"? Get real.
--Ms. Canal!

01:12:04.410 --> 01:12:06.538
You're all beat up.

01:12:06.746 --> 01:12:08.373
Everyone!

01:12:08.581 --> 01:12:12.210
On Master's behalf, we decided,
"Screw the 'small team' idea."

01:12:12.418 --> 01:12:14.295
Real men are duty-bound to fight!

01:12:14.504 --> 01:12:16.297
Man, that thing's huge.

01:12:16.506 --> 01:12:18.424
All right! Let's go!

01:12:20.635 --> 01:12:22.554
The whole gang's here!

01:12:22.762 --> 01:12:24.138
Let's do it, too!

01:12:24.347 --> 01:12:25.682
Aye, Sir!

01:12:30.144 --> 01:12:31.229
Take this!

01:12:40.446 --> 01:12:42.448
Real man! Real man! Real man!

01:12:51.958 --> 01:12:53.084
Everyone...!

01:12:56.588 --> 01:12:59.257
You have wonderful friends.

01:12:59.465 --> 01:13:00.425
Yeah!

01:13:00.633 --> 01:13:03.928
But you're my friend too now, remember?

01:13:06.014 --> 01:13:09.475
So this is what it's like to be happy...

01:13:09.684 --> 01:13:11.561
I'd forgotten after all this time.

01:13:11.769 --> 01:13:13.313
Eclair...

01:13:14.814 --> 01:13:16.357
Eclair?!

01:13:16.566 --> 01:13:17.817
Oh, no...

01:13:18.026 --> 01:13:21.613
The Phoenix is gathering power...

01:13:27.368 --> 01:13:28.745
It's...

01:13:29.579 --> 01:13:30.955
This isn't good...

01:13:37.045 --> 01:13:39.464
Natsu. It's absorbing my magic power...

01:13:39.672 --> 01:13:42.050
Don't give up, Happy!

01:13:50.558 --> 01:13:53.186
What's going on? My body is suddenly...

01:13:53.394 --> 01:13:56.189
The Phoenix is sucking up magic power.

01:13:56.397 --> 01:13:57.273
Huh?

01:13:57.482 --> 01:14:01.194
It's absorbing the magic
power of all living things...

01:14:01.402 --> 01:14:03.571
...to destroy the world.

01:14:03.780 --> 01:14:07.700
This is bad! If it uses that huge thing...!

01:14:07.909 --> 01:14:09.869
Why would it do that...?

01:14:10.078 --> 01:14:12.830
The Phoenix wishes for true revival.

01:14:13.039 --> 01:14:17.669
It will destroy itself and
the world to accomplish that.

01:14:17.877 --> 01:14:20.213
But only the Phoenix will revive.

01:14:20.421 --> 01:14:21.339
Are you serious?!

01:14:21.547 --> 01:14:23.675
That's why it must be stopped...

01:14:23.883 --> 01:14:26.552
...no matter the sacrifice.

01:14:26.761 --> 01:14:28.596
Master!

01:14:28.805 --> 01:14:32.141
Isn't that right, Lady Eclair?

01:14:34.477 --> 01:14:35.603
But how?

01:14:35.812 --> 01:14:40.650
The Fire People and their technique
to seal it away no longer exist...

01:14:40.858 --> 01:14:43.945
We will destroy it, not seal it!

01:14:44.153 --> 01:14:48.908
400 years ago, the wizard
Kalard completed a magic item

01:14:49.117 --> 01:14:50.910
for use against the Phoenix:

01:14:51.119 --> 01:14:52.954
The Arrow of Evil's Destruction.

01:14:53.162 --> 01:14:57.291
And your father entrusted it to the Council.

01:14:57.500 --> 01:15:02.422
So my father did complete the Dispel magic?

01:15:05.425 --> 01:15:09.637
The Arrow of Evil's Destruction
will fully annihilate the Phoenix.

01:15:09.846 --> 01:15:12.557
However, those who have consumed its blood

01:15:12.765 --> 01:15:15.393
will disappear from this world as well.

01:15:15.601 --> 01:15:17.145
Oh, no!

01:15:17.353 --> 01:15:21.441
When I give the signal, Erza will fire the arrow.

01:15:32.076 --> 01:15:33.703
Erza would never fire it!

01:15:33.911 --> 01:15:36.998
| haven't explained the details to her.

01:15:37.206 --> 01:15:40.168
| will bear the sin in full.

01:15:41.753 --> 01:15:44.464
Hurry. I'm fine with what will happen.

01:15:44.672 --> 01:15:46.090
No!

01:15:47.800 --> 01:15:49.844
No! Don't!

01:15:50.970 --> 01:15:51.846
Master!

01:15:52.055 --> 01:15:53.765
It's okay, Lucy.

01:15:53.973 --> 01:15:55.892
No! It's absolutely not!

01:15:56.100 --> 01:15:58.728
I've lived for 400 years.

01:15:58.936 --> 01:16:01.856
| don't need eternal life anymore.

01:16:05.651 --> 01:16:08.029
If anything will be truly eternal...

01:16:08.237 --> 01:16:10.656
...it will be my memories of being with others.

01:16:10.865 --> 01:16:17.497
I'm sure I'll never forget Fairy Tail or you, Lucy...

01:16:17.705 --> 01:16:19.040
Thank you...

01:16:19.248 --> 01:16:20.666
Lucy...

01:16:24.670 --> 01:16:26.839
Momon is waiting for me.

01:16:27.048 --> 01:16:29.175
O arrow! Destroy the evil!

01:16:30.134 --> 01:16:32.386
No!

01:16:43.815 --> 01:16:44.982
Natsul!

01:16:51.197 --> 01:16:53.324
Eclair! Eclair!

01:16:53.533 --> 01:16:55.159
Eclair!

01:17:00.081 --> 01:17:00.957
Oh, no!

01:17:01.165 --> 01:17:01.958
Crap...

01:17:02.166 --> 01:17:05.086
--Laxus!
--This is bad, isn't it?!

01:17:18.307 --> 01:17:21.644
If it comes down, everyone will die.

01:17:22.728 --> 01:17:25.231
Natsu... It's up to you...

01:17:48.004 --> 01:17:50.423
Someone, help!

01:18:17.491 --> 01:18:20.828
I'm glad to have met you, Lucy...

01:18:21.037 --> 01:18:23.331
Don't go! Eclair!

01:18:31.714 --> 01:18:33.049
Lucy...

01:18:34.217 --> 01:18:36.761
I'll never forget you.

01:18:36.969 --> 01:18:39.388
No!

01:18:43.476 --> 01:18:46.312
Eclair!

01:19:00.785 --> 01:19:03.037
Thank you, Natsu.

01:19:03.246 --> 01:19:05.581
Lucy is filled with sadness.

01:19:05.790 --> 01:19:07.959
Take good care of her, okay?

01:19:20.680 --> 01:19:23.224
We have to go now.

01:19:23.432 --> 01:19:27.353
Thank you all, people of Fairy Tail...

01:19:55.715 --> 01:19:58.718
| had no idea this would happen...

01:20:10.021 --> 01:20:13.733
Eclair... Eclair...

01:20:18.154 --> 01:20:19.655
Natsu...

01:20:19.864 --> 01:20:23.659
Is magic good? Or is it bad?

01:20:32.877 --> 01:20:36.756
| don't care if it's good or if it's bad...

01:20:36.964 --> 01:20:41.218
...I just wish there was a
magic spell for stopping tears...!

01:20:47.767 --> 01:20:51.187
Eclair was smiling at the very end.

01:20:52.480 --> 01:20:54.648
Natsu...

01:20:54.857 --> 01:20:56.859
It's okay.

01:20:57.068 --> 01:20:58.903
We're in this together.

01:21:44.281 --> 01:22:04.593
Where is time going to take your tears?

01:22:10.141 --> 01:22:31.620
Will I find your smile there someday?

01:22:34.623 --> 01:22:47.303
The sky we always looked at says

01:22:47.511 --> 01:23:05.154
The rest of our dreams will never end

01:23:05.362 --> 01:23:31.055
Forever, forever, our memories will be gentle

01:23:31.263 --> 01:23:41.732
So I'm sure, I'm sure

01:23:41.941 --> 01:23:55.454
that I'll go to the next future

01:24:24.733 --> 01:24:50.551
Forever, forever, these feelings
of love will never disappear

01:24:50.759 --> 01:25:01.145
So I'm sure, I'm sure

01:25:01.353 --> 01:25:14.199
that I'll go to the next future

01:25:14.408 --> 01:25:31.467
Forever, I'm sure, with you

01:25:49.568 --> 01:25:52.279
What wonderful magic!
